              unreachable, nneeeeddffrraagg, ssrrccffaaiill source route failed, nneett‐‐uunnkk net‐
              work  unknown, hhoosstt‐‐uunnkk host unknown, iissoollaattee, nneett‐‐pprroohhiibb admin‐
